  "description": "RETRODEO is a bold retro western display font inspired by classic rodeo posters, vintage saloon signage, and old Americana spirit. With strong slab serifs, confident curves, and rugged letterforms, RETRODEO captures the raw energy of the Wild West while staying clean and highly readable.\nDesigned to stand out, this font is perfect for logos, apparel, packaging, posters, signage, album covers, and branding that needs a nostalgic yet powerful western character. RETRODEO blends timeless cowboy heritage with a modern edge—making it ideal for both authentic retro projects and contemporary designs seeking bold personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>RETRODEO is a bold retro western display font inspired by classic rodeo posters, vintage saloon signage, and old Americana spirit. With strong slab serifs, confident curves, and rugged letterforms, RETRODEO captures the raw energy of the Wild West while staying clean and highly readable.</p>\n<p>Designed to stand out, this font is perfect for logos, apparel, packaging, posters, signage, album covers, and branding that needs a nostalgic yet powerful western character. RETRODEO blends timeless cowboy heritage with a modern edge—making it ideal for both authentic retro projects and contemporary designs seeking bold personality.</p>",
